<title>USA: First Mortgage sees 1998 financial gains.</title>
<headline>First Mortgage sees 1998 financial gains.</headline>
<dateline>DIAMOND BAR, Calif. 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Mortgage Corp said Friday that if interest rates remain stable or decline, it expects to continue to realize financial gains in the remainder of fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>First Mortgage reported earnings of $0.05 a share for the fiscal first quarter ended June 30, 1997, compared to $0.02 a share the previous first quarter.</p>
